# Wiki clone (developer tool, not part of the product)
.wiki/

# Self-referencing submodule (dev testing, not part of the product)
.ai-lindale/

# Claude Code harness worktrees (isolation: worktree default location; not
# Lindalë-configured — see DX-034 / #80). Defensive: worktrees are their own
# git checkouts and shouldn't be tracked from the main tree, but ignore
# explicitly in case of accidental staging.
.claude/worktrees/

# BUG-006 stage-and-return fallback artifacts (dev.md / tpm.md / patterns.md):
# per-run handoff files a dev subagent leaves in its worktree for the TPM to
# finalize from. They are session state, not repo content — ignore them so a
# stray `git add -A` after they're written can't commit them into a PR.
.claude/commit-msg.txt
.claude/pr-body.md
.claude/pr-body-*.md
